licant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HITACHI, LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOBAYASHI, SETSUO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YANAGAWA, KAZUHIKO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOBAYASHI SETSUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YANAGAWA KAZUHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOBAYASHI, SETSUO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YANAGAWA, KAZUHIKO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A liquid crystal display element comprising a pair of substrates and a liquid crystal layer disposed between the pair of substrates. One of the substrates includes a plurality of electrodes for applying electric fields parallel substantially with the substrate to the liquid crystal layer, a protective layer for at least one of the electrodes, and an alignment layer formed over the protective layer or electrode. The alignment layer is adapted to cause AC persistence of less than 8%, resulting in a high-quality image display free of failure due to AC persistence.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention porte sur un élément d'afficheur à cristaux liquides comprenant une paire de substrats et une couche de cristaux liquides située entre les deux substrats. Un des substrats comporte une pluralité d'électrodes qui appliquent des champs électriques sensiblement parallèles au substrat et à la couche de cristaux liquides, une couche protectrice destinée à au moins une des électrodes et une couche d'alignement formée sur la couche protectrice ou l'électrode. Cette couche d'alignement est prévue pour induire une persistance du courant alternatif inférieure à 8 %, ceci permettant d'obtenir un afficheur d'image de grande qualité dépourvu des défauts dus à la persistance du courant alternatif.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>